{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Morning, Mr Jacobs. Doctor's still stuck on the computer. The machine reads blood pressure one fifty two over ninety four, pulse seventy eight.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Your wife phoned the rooms yesterday. Says you snore the whole night.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Rubbish.",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (DOCTOR): Sorry, one second. Load shedding knocked the server again. Right. Headaches, Mr Jacobs?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (DOCTOR): How long for?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Years.",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (DOCTOR): Say that again? I opened the wrong letter.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): Years.",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (DOCTOR): Booking note says the pattern changed.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Mornings.",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (DOCTOR): Worse in the mornings?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (DOCTOR): Every day?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Most.",
  "[SEG0017] person_3 (DOCTOR): Most what? This pop-up won't close.",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): Most mornings.",
  "[SEG0019] person_3 (DOCTOR): Any vomiting with them?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0021] person_3 (DOCTOR): When did the morning ones begin? I need a date I can type.",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): Few weeks. Maybe. Don't know.",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): She also said he's tired all day. Her words, not mine.",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (DOCTOR): Daytime tiredness. Yes or no?",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0026] person_3 (DOCTOR): What are you taking for the head?",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): Imigran. Panado.",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (DOCTOR): Sumatriptan. Which strength?",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): The repeat script says sumatriptan one hundred milligrams.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (PATIENT): Fifty. Most days.",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): The scanned chemist label says one hundred as well.",
  "[SEG0032] person_3 (DOCTOR): Fifty from you, a hundred on the label. I'm leaving the dose blank till I see the box.",
  "[SEG0033] person_3 (DOCTOR): Where's the cursor gone. And the Panado?",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (PATIENT): Two. When it hurts.",
  "[SEG0035] person_3 (DOCTOR): Any other tablets? Blood pressure treatment?",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0037] person_3 (DOCTOR): Those old headaches were migraines, hey?",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0039] person_3 (DOCTOR): Ever had a scan of the head?",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0041] person_3 (DOCTOR): What did they say?",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (PATIENT): Borderline.",
  "[SEG0043] person_3 (DOCTOR): CT or MRI? The cursor jumped, say again.",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (PATIENT): CT. Years back.",
  "[SEG0045] person_3 (DOCTOR): Report's not in the file, shame. Any fits?",
  "[SEG0046] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0047] person_3 (DOCTOR): Double vision?",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0049] person_3 (DOCTOR): Weakness in the arms?",
  "[SEG0050] person_2 (PATIENT): Mm, I suppose.",
  "[SEG0051] person_3 (DOCTOR): Sounded like a yes. Is it actually weak?",
  "[SEG0052] person_2 (PATIENT): Sometimes. Not really.",
  "[SEG0053] person_3 (DOCTOR): I won't record that as a firm yes. Quick look. Follow my finger. Eyes track fine.",
  "[SEG0054] person_3 (DOCTOR): No facial droop. Pupils equal and reacting. Grip equal both hands. Neck's not stiff.",
  "[SEG0055] person_2 (PATIENT): Ow.",
  "[SEG0056] person_3 (DOCTOR): Scalp tender both sides, more on the left. That's non-specific.",
  "[SEG0057] person_3 (DOCTOR): Provisionally this is still your migraine, but mornings with vomiting is a real change, so I can't rule out raised pressure.",
  "[SEG0058] person_3 (DOCTOR): I'm not booking a scan today. If the morning headaches and the vomiting are still there in two weeks, then we do a CT head.",
  "[SEG0059] person_3 (DOCTOR): Come back if it's not settling in two weeks. Bring the Imigran box, write down how many Panado you take, and don't drive if you've just vomited.",
  "[SEG0060] person_2 (PATIENT): Fine.",
  "[SEG0061] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): I'll flag the dose mismatch on the file.",
  "[SEG0062] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Parking's a proper mess out front, the queue's round the block.",
  "[SEG0063] person_3 (DOCTOR): Ag, never mind the parking. We're finished here."
 ],
